*** Keywords ***
Start Downlink Test
    [Documentation]  Starts 5G Downlink Test. Distinction is needed due to differences
    ...              in branches e.g. there is no nrarfcn param on 5G20B instead of newer BTS softwares.
    [Arguments]                                             ${test_id}=1
    ...                                                     ${spec_ssb_beam_pattern}=${None}
    ...                                                     &{kwargs}

    ${test_model}=           Get From Dictionary            ${kwargs}        test_model
    Robot Log Operation                                     Starting ${test_id} 5G Downlink Test with ${test_model}...

    webui.start_5g_downlink_test                            spec_ssb_beam_pattern=${spec_ssb_beam_pattern}
    ...                                                     &{kwargs}

    webui.wait_for_5g_downlink_test_to_start                timeout=120
    ...                                                     test_id=${test_id}

    Robot Log Result                                        5G Downlink Test has started.

Get Pmax For Test Module Activation
    [Documentation]
    ...  Gets pmax needed for test module activation. If pmax is provided, then nothing changes, but if None will be
    ...  detected, pmax will be read from current SCF configuration on BTS.
    [Arguments]                                             ${cell_id}
    ...                                                     ${pmax}
    ...                                                     ${download_dir}
    ...                                                     ${connection}

    admin.get_current_scf_file                              local_dir_path=${download_dir}
    ...                                                     file_name=temp_scf.xml
    ...                                                     timeout=30s
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ${read_pmax}=  run keyword if  '${pmax}' == '${None}'   scf.get_pmax_of_cell
    ...                                                     cell_id=${cell_id}
    ...            ELSE            set variable             ${pmax}
    [Return]  ${read_pmax}

Get NR Cells Ids
    [Documentation]
    ...  Gets ids of all configured NR cells based on current SCF configuration file.
    [Arguments]                                             ${download_dir}
    ...                                                     ${connection}
    ...                                                     ${file_name}=temp_scf.xml

    admin.get_current_scf_file                              local_dir_path=${download_dir}
    ...                                                     file_name=${file_name}
    ...                                                     timeout=30s
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ${cells_ids}=                                           scf.get_nrcell_id_list
    ...                                                     scf_path=${download_dir}/${file_name}
    Robot Log Variable                                      variable=${cells_ids}

    [Return]  ${cells_ids}

Get Required Parameters of All Cells Needed to Test Module Activation
    [Documentation]
    ...  Gets required cells parameters needed for test module activation.
    ...  Returned parameters: local_cell_id, cell_nrarfcn, cell_pmax
    [Arguments]                                             ${cells_ids}
    ...                                                     ${download_dir}
    ...                                                     ${connection}
    ...                                                     ${file_name}=temp_scf.xml

    admin.get_current_scf_file                              local_dir_path=${download_dir}
    ...                                                     file_name=${file_name}
    ...                                                     timeout=30s
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    ${cells_params}=                                        scf.get_nr_tdd_cells_details
    ...                                                     cells_ids=${cells_ids}
    ...                                                     scf_path=${download_dir}/${file_name}

    [Return]  ${cells_params}

Stop Downlink Test Module
    [Arguments]                                             ${test_id}=1
    ...                                                     ${timeout}=10
    webui.stop_5g_downlink_test                             timeout=${timeout}
    ...                                                     test_id=${test_id}
    webui.wait_for_5g_downlink_test_to_stop                 timeout=40
    ...                                                     test_id=${test_id}
    Robot Log Operation                                     Test model ${test_id} was stopped successfully.

Stop Downlink Test Module And Save Results
    [Arguments]                                             ${text_for_test}
    ...                                                     ${download_dir}
    ...                                                     ${nr_cell}
    ...                                                     ${connection}
    ...                                                     ${test_id}=1
    ...                                                     ${timeout}=10
    webui.stop_5g_downlink_test                             timeout=${timeout}    test_id=${test_id}
    webui.wait_for_5g_downlink_test_to_stop                 timeout=40            test_id=${test_id}
    Robot Log Operation                                     Test model ${test_id} was stopped successfully.
    webui.save_5g_downlink_test_results                     external_equipment_result=${text_for_test}
    ${result_file_path}=                                    report_parser.setup_test_model_file_name_with_path
    ...                                                     download_dir=${download_dir}
    ...                                                     test_type=downlink
    ...                                                     nr_cell=${nr_cell}
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer  6s  2s         OperatingSystem.File Should Exist  path=${result_file_path}
    [Return]                                                ${result_file_path}

Check Content Of Test Results And Refresh Page
    [Arguments]                                             ${text_for_test}
    ...                                                     ${result_file_path}
    report_parser.check_content_of_test_results             carrier_freq=${EMPTY}
    ...                                                     carrier_unit=${EMPTY}
    ...                                                     input_text=${text_for_test}
    ...                                                     file_path=${result_file_path}
    webui.refresh_page                                      wait_bar_menu_timeout=60

Check Unavailability Of Downlink Test Module
    [Arguments]                                             ${nr_cell}
    ...                                                     ${test_model}
    @{test_models_list}=                                   tm_startup.create_test_models_list
    ...                                                     test_model=${test_model}
    FOR  ${test_model}    IN     @{test_models_list}
        ${test_available}=                                  webui.is_5g_downlink_test_available
        ...                                                 local_cell=NRCELL-${nr_cell}
        ...                                                 test_model=${test_model}
        should not be true                                  ${test_available}
    END

Get Downlink Carrier Frequency
    [Arguments]                                             ${webui_obj}
    ...                                                     ${nr_cell}=0
    ${value_with_unit}                                      tm_startup.selenium_get_cell_carrier_frequency
    ...                                                     webui=${webui_obj}
    ...                                                     cell_id=${nr_cell}
    ${direct_value}                                         set variable  ${value_with_unit[:-3]}
    ${center_freq}                                          evaluate    ${direct_value} / ${1000}
    [Return]                                                ${center_freq}

Downlink Test Activation Teardown
    Run keywords              Run keyword and ignore error  webui.stop_5g_downlink_test
    ...                       AND
    ...                       Run keyword and ignore error  webui.wait_for_5g_downlink_test_to_stop
    ...                       AND
    ...                       Run keyword and ignore error  webui.refresh_page
    ...                       AND
    ...                       Connections.Close Selenium Session

Downlink Test Verification Teardown
    [Arguments]                                             ${analyzer}
    Run keywords              Run keyword and ignore error  webui.stop_5g_downlink_test
    ...                       AND
    ...                       Run keyword and ignore error  webui.wait_for_5g_downlink_test_to_stop
    ...                       AND
    ...                       Run keyword and ignore error  Unlock signal analyzer  analyzer=${analyzer}
    ...                       AND
    ...                       Run keyword and ignore error  webui.refresh_page
    ...                       AND
    ...                       Connections.Close Selenium Session

